#!/bin/bash

# tam-agent-crash — diagnose a crashed process with the default coding agent.
#
#   tam-agent-crash <pid> [comm] [exe] [signal]
#
# Clicked from a "Process crashed:" notification (tam-crash-watch), or run by
# hand against any PID in `coredumpctl list`. The method lives in the
# diagnose-crash skill so it is edited in one place and works with whichever
# agent is default; this only gathers the facts and points at it.
#
# Ported from Omarchy 4.0.4 (omarchy-agent-crash) for plan 18 R4.15d. It
# reads the selected Tamlinux skill from the user generation's data directory.
